{"id":"655311","name":"柠檬泡椒无骨鸡爪","author":"五加五左左","authorId":"11514294","desc":"","cover":"images/655311/cover.jpg","ingredients":{"main":[{"name":"鸡爪","amount":"1000g"},{"name":"柠檬","amount":"2颗"}],"sub":[{"name":"葱","amount":"1把"},{"name":"姜","amount":"1块"},{"name":"蒜","amount":"4-5颗"},{"name":"洋葱","amount":"半个"},{"name":"香菜","amount":"2颗"},{"name":"小米辣","amount":"3颗"},{"name":"杭椒","amount":"5颗"}]},"steps":[{"step":1,"desc":"鸡爪洗干净。","img":"images/655311/step_1.jpg"},{"step":2,"desc":"减掉指甲。","img":"images/655311/step_2.jpg"},{"step":3,"desc":"准备配料。","img":"images/655311/step_3.jpg"},{"step":4,"desc":"凉水下锅煮鸡爪，放入葱姜。","img":"images/655311/step_4.jpg"},{"step":5,"desc":"倒入料酒。","img":"images/655311/step_5.jpg"},{"step":6,"desc":"准备辣椒。","img":"images/655311/step_6.jpg"},{"step":7,"desc":"大火煮沸，撇去浮沫。","img":"images/655311/step_7.jpg"},{"step":8,"desc":"撇去浮沫再煮一会儿，把鸡爪煮熟。","img":"images/655311/step_8.jpg"},{"step":9,"desc":"捞出以后，加入冰块。我没有冰块，从冰箱拿出了冷冻的虾，用来降温。","img":"images/655311/step_9.jpg"},{"step":10,"desc":"鸡爪用冰水泡二十分钟以后，开始脱骨，手工脱的，有点废手。","img":"images/655311/step_10.jpg"},{"step":11,"desc":"柠檬切片，去除籽，不去籽会苦。","img":"images/655311/step_11.jpg"},{"step":12,"desc":"盐糖花椒鸡精一丢丢。","img":"images/655311/step_12.jpg"},{"step":13,"desc":"酱油2勺。","img":"images/655311/step_13.jpg"},{"step":14,"desc":"醋2勺。","img":"images/655311/step_14.jpg"},{"step":15,"desc":"雪碧大半瓶，留了一口，为了减脂很久没有喝碳酸饮料的人，喝上一口。","img":"images/655311/step_15.jpg"},{"step":16,"desc":"切好配料。","img":"images/655311/step_16.jpg"},{"step":17,"desc":"料汁再兑一点水。","img":"images/655311/step_17.jpg"},{"step":18,"desc":"把鸡爪和配料混合在一起。","img":"images/655311/step_18.jpg"},{"step":19,"desc":"颜值很棒。","img":"images/655311/step_19.jpg"},{"step":20,"desc":"味道也很棒。","img":"images/655311/step_20.jpg"}],"tips":"来自 美食天下  的作品\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t使用的厨具：煮锅\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t所属分类：","attrs":{}}